  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3006.04 Allowable Use",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3006.04 Allowable Use. Stationary sources may use ERCs, upon division approval, to satisfy any requirement under the Act or RSA 125-C for:\n\n(a) Offsets;\n\n(b) RACT;\n\n(c) Bubbling; and\n\n(d) RESERVED.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
